    "directions": [
      "In a grinder jar, add boiled chickpeas and grind it to a smooth texture.",
      "Transfer this mixture into a bowl, add ginger garlic paste, green chilli, garam masala, coriander powder, red chilli powder, gram flour and mix well.",
      "Now , add lemon juice, coriander leaves and salt to taste and mix everything well.",
      "Heat oil in a deep pan, shallow fry the tiki from both the sides.",
      "Till nice golden and crisp from all over the sides and properly cooked.",
      "Serve hot chole tikki with green chutney."
    ],
